## Upstream projects

### Chatterbox — Resemble AI (MIT)

  https://github.com/resemble-ai/chatterbox
  Copyright (c) 2025 Resemble AI

The TTS models this project converts and runs, and the reference implementation
every stage of this port is validated against:

  - ResembleAI/chatterbox-turbo      https://huggingface.co/ResembleAI/chatterbox-turbo
  - ResembleAI/chatterbox-nano       https://huggingface.co/ResembleAI/chatterbox-nano
  - ResembleAI/chatterbox            https://huggingface.co/ResembleAI/chatterbox

All three are published under the MIT licence. The converted CoreML artifacts
distributed at huggingface.co/iliasaz/chatterbox-*-coreml are derivatives of those
weights and carry the same terms.

`default-conds.safetensors` — the built-in default voice — is upstream's own, not
something recorded for this project.

### Perth (Perth-Net Implicit watermarker) — Resemble AI (MIT)

  https://github.com/resemble-ai/Perth
  Copyright (c) 2025 Resemble AI

Every utterance this pipeline generates is watermarked with Perth, as upstream
chatterbox does. Ported to CoreML in https://github.com/iliasaz/perth-coreml.

### RUAccent — Denis Petrov (MIT)

  https://github.com/Den4ikAI/ruaccent
  Copyright 2026 Denis Petrov

Russian lexical stress and homograph resolution, used to place stress marks before
multilingual synthesis. The weights come from https://huggingface.co/ruaccent/accentuator
(MIT). Ported to CoreML in https://github.com/iliasaz/ruaccent-coreml.

### Demo voice prompts — Resemble AI

The bundled reference voices are conditioning bundles derived from Resemble AI's own
published demo prompts — the same audio their Chatterbox demo applications use, by
anonymous speakers identified only by language and gender. Only the derived
`*-conds.safetensors` are distributed here; the source audio is not redistributed.
Source URLs and per-voice provenance:
ChatterboxApp/ChatterboxApp/Voices/README.md


